E-Commerce Backend (Spring Boot)

  This project is currently under development and represents the backend-only part of an e-commerce application.
  
  I am building this project independently while learning backend development and real-world system design. 
  The goal of this project is not just to make APIs work, but to understand proper backend flow, security, and architecture used in real production systems.
  
  At this stage, the project is functionally complete for core e-commerce flows, but future improvements and refinements are still planned.
  
  Thank you for taking the time to review this repository.
  I really appreciate it.
  
  Peace

