## Features
  User Registration & Login (JWT-based authentication)
  Role-based Authorization (ADMIN / USER)
  Secure Product Management (Admin only)
  Secure Image Upload & Validation
  Cart Management (Add / Remove / View)
  Order Creation from Cart (Immutable Order Snapshot)
  Order History (User-specific)
  Payment Processing (Simulated)
  Order Status Protection (CREATED → PAID / FAILED)
  Global Exception Handling with clean API responses
  MongoDB Integration
  Clean DTO-based API responses (No internal IDs exposed)

Modules Overview
  Auth Module
  Register & Login
  JWT token generation
  Role-based access control

Product Module
  Create product (ADMIN only)
  Fetch all products
  Fetch product details
  Delete product

Cart Module
  One cart per authenticated user
  Add product to cart
  Update quantity
  Remove product from cart
  Cart is cleared after successful order/payment

Order Module
  Create order from cart
  Order snapshot (independent of cart)
  Order history per user
  Order status lifecycle:
  CREATED
  PAID
  FAILED

Payment Module (Simulated)
  Payment processed via backend (no frontend yet)
  Transaction ID generation
  Status update based on payment result
  Designed to easily integrate real payment gateways later (Razorpay / Stripe / PayPal)

Security
  Stateless JWT authentication
  Role-based endpoint protection
  Users can access only their own data
  Admin privileges limited to product management
  No user can see another user’s orders

## Tech Stack
- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- Spring Security
- JWT
- MongoDB
- Maven

## API Modules
Auth
Products
Cart
Orders
Payment

